  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程資訊管理",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING INFORMATION MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養碩士班學生於工程資訊管理中的進階能力，學生將學習如何整合資料庫、程式設計與人工智慧技術，支援工程資料分析、文件生成、設計輔助及決策支援。課程內容涵蓋：工程資料庫設計、工程應用程式開發、生成式 AI 工具於工程領域的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to cultivate graduate students’ advanced competencies in engineering information management. Students will learn to integrate database design, programming, and artificial intelligence technologies to support engineering data analysis, document generation, design assistance, and decision-making. The course covers the following topics: engineering database design, engineering application development, and the application of generative AI tools in engineering.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
